# Only @acexode is a real GitHub handle today. The agent entries below are
# COMMENTS, not owner lines, because CODEOWNERS entries naming teams that do not
# exist produce repository warnings and can make pull requests unmergeable once
# "require review from Code Owners" is enabled. When real GitHub teams exist,
# uncomment them.
#
# Review model (DECISION-LOG.md D-A3, revised 2026-09-27): @acexode personally
# reviews every pull request touching auth, permissions, RLS/migrations,
# payments/e-invoicing, recordings/PCI, and export/DSAR. Everything else the
# lead merges on green CI plus reviewer-subagent verdicts.
#
# IMPORTANT: these lines are only a GATE if "Require review from Code Owners" is
# enabled in branch protection. Until then they route and leave an audit trail
# but do not block a merge. Enabling it is part of T-0005 and needs @acexode.

# Default owner for anything not matched below.
